            provider directly. If there is immediate danger in India, call 112
            rather than relying on map results.
          </p>
          <button type="button" onClick={openSos}>
            Open emergency options <ArrowUpRight size={17} />
          </button>
          <a
            href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"
            target="_blank"
